#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:1
msgid "Binary Installation on Ubuntu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:3
msgid ""
"Dome binaries are provided for Ubuntu Bionic and Focal. All of the Dome "
"binaries are hosted in the osrfoundation repository. To install all of them, "
"the metapackage `ignition-dome` can be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:7
msgid "First install some necessary tools:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:9
msgid ""
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install lsb-release wget gnupg\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:14
msgid "Then install Ignition Dome:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:17
msgid ""
"sudo sh -c 'echo \"deb https://packages.osrfoundation.org/gazebo/ubuntu-"
"stable `lsb_release -cs` main\" > /etc/apt/sources.list.d/gazebo-stable."
"list'\n"
"wget https://packages.osrfoundation.org/gazebo.key -O - | sudo apt-key add "
"-\n"
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install ignition-dome\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:24
msgid ""
"All libraries should be ready to use and the `ign gazebo` app ready to be "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:26
msgid ""
"Head back to the [Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Ignition!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:29
msgid "Uninstalling binary install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:31
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Ignition or switch to a source-based install once "
"you have already installed the library from binaries, run the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:34
msgid "sudo apt remove ignition-dome && sudo apt autoremove\n"
msgstr ""

